  "body": "After many happy years here, the vendors are firmly committed to their next move, creating an exciting opportunity for buyers to secure their place in one of Auckland's most tightly held coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nSet on a prized 607sqm freehold site, this warm and beautifully presented mid-century home delivers the Eastern Bays lifestyle buyers are constantly chasing, while still offering exciting scope to further add value over time.\r\n\r\nBathed in natural light, the home combines timeless character with relaxed modern living. Blonded timber floors, open-plan spaces and seamless indoor-outdoor flow create an atmosphere that feels instantly welcoming.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the stylish kitchen, dining and living area opens effortlessly to a sun-soaked backyard designed for entertaining, family living and long summer evenings. Lush gardens and visiting tui create a setting that feels private, peaceful and unmistakably \"home\".\r\n\r\nThree generous bedrooms are complemented by a versatile additional room ideal as a media lounge, work-from-home office, nursery or guest retreat.\r\n\r\nA beautifully appointed family bathroom with luxurious soaker tub, separate shower and separate WC adds everyday practicality, while downstairs offers a substantial double garage, dedicated laundry and excellent storage.\r\n\r\nFor buyers with an eye to the future, there is also clear potential to further enhance and add value, whether through reconfiguration, additional bathrooms or creating a master suite/ensuite option (subject to council approval).\r\n\r\nFamilies will love the fully fenced grounds, while professionals and downsizers alike will appreciate the ease of single-level living.\r\n\r\nPositioned just moments from the waterfront and village atmosphere of St Heliers, you are perfectly placed to enjoy beaches, cafés, coastal walkways and the very best of the Eastern Bays lifestyle. Churchill Park, local sports clubs and some of Auckland's most sought-after schools are all close by, including Glendowie School, Glendowie College and Sacred Heart College.\r\n\r\nSingle-level homes on freehold sites in Glendowie are becoming increasingly rare.\r\n\r\nAct quickly. Opportunities like this do not last long.",
